  id: so_thu_chi_2002
  ten: "s\u1ED5 thu chi 2002"
  kieu: 1
  ghiChu: "S\u1ED5 thu chi c\u1EE7a nh\xE0, n\xE9t ch\u1EEF c\u1EE7a m\u1EB9."
  trang:
  - "<b>THU CHI \u2014 2002</b>\n\n<i>N\xE9t ch\u1EEF c\u1EE7a m\u1EB9, nh\u1ECF,
    \u0111\u1EC1u.</i>\n\nTh\xE1ng 6\n\n2/6      Ti\u1EC1n h\u1ECDc con Nh\xEDm ...............
    120.000\n5/6      Ch\u1EE3 ....................................... 45.000\n11/6   
    Ti\u1EC1n n\u01B0\u1EDBc ................................ 38.000\n20/6    Thu\u1ED1c
    con Nh\xEDm ...................... 60.000\n28/6    C\xFAng r\u1EB1m .................................
    150.000"
  - "Th\xE1ng 7\n\n3/7      Ch\u1EE3 ....................................... 52.000\n8/7     
    Thu\u1ED1c con Nh\xEDm ...................... 80.000\n12/7    Ti\u1EC1n \u0111i\u1EC7n
    th\xE1ng 6 .................. 186.000\n14/7    Thu\u1ED1c con Nh\xEDm ......................
    95.000\n15/7    Ch\u1EE3 ....................................... 40.000\n26/7   
    Ti\u1EC1n \u0111i\u1EC7n th\xE1ng 7 .................. 192.000"
  - "Th\xE1ng 8\n\n1/8      Thu\u1ED1c con Nh\xEDm ...................... 95.000\n2/8     
    B\xE1c s\u0129 sang b\xF3 b\u1ED9t ................. 150.000\n3/8      Ch\u1EE3
    ....................................... 40.000\n<size=23><i>4/8      \u1EE8ng
    cho th\u1EB1ng Phong ....... 1.980.000</i></size>\n\n<i>(d\xF2ng cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng
    c\u1EE7a c\u1EA3 cu\u1ED1n s\u1ED5: n\xE9t ch\u1EEF kh\xE1c \u2014 to, nghi\xEAng,
    n\xE9t c\u1EE7a b\u1ED1)</i>"
  khiNhat: []
  tuDem: 1
  chuaToi: 
  docTuDem: 0
  chuaDoc: "Mai h\u1EB5ng \u0111\u1ECDc."
  canCo: 
  chuaCo: 
